# NIST AI Risk Management Framework 1.0 — function mapping — version 2026.10.1
# https://foxxi-bridge.interego.xwisee.com/ns/nist-rmf  (this version: https://foxxi-bridge.interego.xwisee.com/ns/nist-rmf/2026.10.1)
